==English==

===Alternative forms===
* {{alter|en|zipcode|ZIP Code|ZIP code|Zip Code|Zip code|ZIP CODE}}

===Etymology===
From {{m|en|ZIP Code}}, the {{w|USPS}}-owned trademark of the system.

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# {{lb|en|US}} A [[postal code]], especially for addresses served by the US Postal Service, consisting of a five- or nine-figure number.
#: {{syn|en|zip|ZIP}}
#: {{hyper|en|postal code|post code}}
# {{lb|en|by extension}} Any [[postal code]].
